<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH SHELL TO RAISE DIESEL PRICES.</title>
<headline>DUTCH SHELL TO RAISE DIESEL PRICES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Dutch/Shell unit Shell Nederland said on Thursday it would raise the price of diesel in the Netherlands by 1.6 guilder cents to 1.54 guilders a litre from October 5.</p>
<p>The move reflects changes in international product prices and fluctuations in the rate of the dollar against the guilder, Shell Nederland said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
